{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Monsters are enemies found in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],", the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],", the ",["l","采石场矿井","Quarry Mine"],", the ",["l","突变虫穴","Mutant Bug Lair"],", the ",["l","火山地牢","Volcano Dungeon"],", the ",["l","秘密森林","Secret Woods"],", and, optionally, on ",["l","农场","the Farm"],". Monsters can attack ",["l","玩家角色","the Player"]," and damage their ",["l","生命值","health"],". When killed, monsters have a chance of dropping ",["l","怪物战利品","Monster Loot"]," and other items. Killing monsters increases the player's ",["l","战斗","combat"]," skill."]]]],["Monsters on the Farm",2,[["p",["Monsters can appear at night on ",["l","农场","the Farm"]," based on the \"Spawn monsters on the farm\" ",["l","选项","advanced option"]," (enabled by default for the Wilderness Farm). It can also be toggled in-game by offering a ",["l","奇怪的小面包","Strange Bun"]," to the ",["l","夜惊之黑暗神殿","Dark Shrine of Night Terrors"]," in the ",["l","女巫小屋","Witch's Hut"],"."]],["p",["Monsters on the farm scale with the player's ",["l","战斗","combat"]," level, with higher levels spawning more difficult monsters and ",["l","荒野石魔","Wilderness Golem"],"s. Monsters killed on the farm grant ",["l","技能","combat XP"]," (though only 1/3 of the standard amount of XP), and count towards ",["l","探险家公会","monster eradication goals"],". However, they don't count towards quest and special order goals."]],["p",["Slimes killed in a ",["l","史莱姆屋","Slime Hutch"]," don't provide XP or count towards eradication goals."]],["p",["Regardless of whether monster spawning is enabled, each ",["l","松露","Truffle"]," dug up by a ",["l","猪","Pig"]," has a 0.2% chance of turning into a ",["l","松露蟹","Truffle Crab"],"."]]]],["Dangerous Monsters",2,[["p",["Monsters in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," and the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"]," are more dangerous during the ",["l","任务","Danger in the Deep"]," and ",["l","任务","Skull Cavern Invasion"]," quests, or while the ",["l","矿井","Shrine of Challenge"]," is toggled on."]],["p",["Dangerous monsters have unique sprites and stats. With few exceptions, their health, damage, and sometimes defense are higher, and their speed identical, when compared to their non-dangerous counterparts. Killing dangerous monsters earns the player the same amount of ",["l","战斗","combat"]," experience points as most of their non-dangerous counterparts."]],["p",["The ",["l","腐臭幽灵","Putrid Ghost"],", ",["l","骷髅法师","Skeleton Mage"],", and ",["l","暗影狙击手","Shadow Sniper"]," feature unique ",["l","效果","debuffs"],"."]]]],["Monsters List",2,[["t",[[{"c":5,"h":1,"v":[["l","矿井","The Mines"]]}],[{"h":1,"v":["All Floors"]},{"h":1,"v":["Floors 1-29"]},{"h":1,"v":["Floors 31-39"]},{"h":1,"v":["Floors 41-79"]},{"h":1,"v":["Floors 81-119"]}],[[["l","史莱姆（怪物）","Green Slime"]],[["l","臭虫","Bug"],["l","苍蝇","Cave Fly"],["l","掘地虫","Duggy"],["l","蛆","Grub"],["l","岩石蟹","Rock Crab"]],["Bat",["l","臭虫","Bug"],["l","石魔","Stone Golem"]],[["l","灰尘精灵","Dust Sprite"],["l","蝙蝠","Frost Bat"],["l","史莱姆（怪物）","Blue Slime"],["l","幽灵","Ghost"],["i","(F)1304","Skeleton"]],[["l","蝙蝠","Lava Bat"],["l","熔岩蟹","Lava Crab"],["l","金属大头","Metal Head"],["l","史莱姆（怪物）","Red Slime"],["l","暗影狂徒","Shadow Brute"],["l","暗影萨满","Shadow Shaman"],["l","鱿鱼娃","Squid Kid"]]]]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":[["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"]]},{"h":1,"v":[["l","采石场矿井","Quarry Mine"]]},{"h":1,"v":[["l","突变虫穴","Mutant Bug Lair"]]},{"h":1,"v":[["l","火山地牢","Volcano Dungeon"]]}],[[["l","甲虫","Armored Bug"],"Big Slime",["l","石碳幽灵","Carbon Ghost"],["l","蝙蝠","Iridium Bat"],["l","铱蟹","Iridium Crab"],["l","蝙蝠","Lava Bat"],["l","木乃伊","Mummy"],["l","霸王喷火龙","Pepper Rex"],["l","史莱姆（怪物）","Purple Slime"],["l","飞蛇","Serpent"]],["Copper Slime",["l","幽灵头骨","Haunted Skull"],"Iron Slime"],[["l","突变苍蝇","Mutant Fly"],["l","突变蛆","Mutant Grub"]],[["l","矮人哨兵","Dwarvish Sentry"],["l","假熔岩菇","False Magma Cap"],["l","熔岩大头","Hot Head"],["l","熔岩潜伏怪","Lava Lurk"],["l","熔岩精灵","Magma Sprite"],["l","熔岩火球","Magma Sparker"],["l","熔岩掘地虫","Magma Duggy"],"Tiger Slime"]]]],["t",[[{"